@startuml Kasir_Transaksi
!theme plain
title SD: Transaksi Kasir (Offline/Tunai)
actor Kasir
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

Kasir -> App: Buka KasirScreen (POS)
App -> API: GET /products
API -> DB: SELECT products
DB --> API: List produk + stok
API --> App: JSON produk
App --> Kasir: Tampil daftar produk

Kasir -> App: Cari produk → pilih layanan & qty
App --> Kasir: Item masuk keranjang kasir

Kasir -> App: (Opsional) Input nama & HP pelanggan
Kasir -> App: Klik "Bayar Tunai"
App -> API: POST /kasir/orders\n{kasir_uid, customer_name, customer_phone, total, items[]}
API -> DB: INSERT orders (status='Selesai',\npayment_status='paid', is_offline=1)
API -> DB: INSERT order_items\nKurangi stok produk (kecuali Isi Ulang)
DB --> API: order_id

alt Ada item Sewa
    API -> DB: INSERT rentals\n(status='active')
end

API --> App: 200 OK
App --> Kasir: "Transaksi tunai berhasil"
App -> App: Bersihkan keranjang kasir

Kasir -> App: Tab Riwayat
App -> API: GET /kasir/transactions/{kasir_uid}
API -> DB: SELECT orders WHERE is_offline=1\nAND user_id = kasir_uid
DB --> API: List transaksi hari ini
API --> App: {today_total, today_count, transactions}
App --> Kasir: Tampil ringkasan + riwayat\n(pendapatan tunai hari ini)

@enduml
